flowchart LR
    A[User writes SQE entry] --> B[smp_wmb]
    B --> C[tail Release store]
    C --> D[Kernel sees tail Acquire]
    D --> E[smp_rmb]
    E --> F[Kernel reads SQE and executes]
    F --> G[Kernel writes CQE]
    G --> H[smp_wmb]
    H --> I[cq tail Release store]
    I --> J[User reads cq tail Acquire]
    J --> K[smp_rmb]
    K --> L[User reads CQE]
